              },
              "content": "{玩家转向Actor0}{A}你是说……你想听神秘现象？",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_1999990020_1583457779_content",
                "value": "{玩家转向Actor0}{A}你是说……你想听神秘现象？",
