              },
              "content": "{A灵光一现}发现地面上出现了奇怪的纹路，\n仿佛有人在地上刻画了一些符号，\n又像有谁走过的巨大脚印……",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_1999990020_1583457786_content",
