              "content": "{A点头}嘤？不愧是<style=PlayerName>{me}</style>，\n确实，我和学社的老师，\n在黑夜中蹲守调查了一整晚……",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_1999990020_1583457798_content",
                "value": "{A点头}嘤？不愧是<style=PlayerName>{me}</style>，\n确实，我和学社的老师，\n在黑夜中蹲守调查了一整晚……",
