                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "{A摊手}黑夜之中，鸟儿无声地沿途捕捉虫子，\n压坏了农作物，形成了地面的纹路。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_1999990020_1583457800_content",
                "value": "{A摊手}黑夜之中，鸟儿无声地沿途捕捉虫子，\n压坏了农作物，形成了地面的纹路。",
